From 45424cd47abd4b2edca4dc46cb34389faedf504c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 06:58:53 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] test: gate-map headers name the crates moved modules live in

Eight suites in crates/app/tests still named post, machining2d, drilling
and tools as app::<module>, which the no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app
law rejects. The headers now name the owning crate: camcraft_post::post,
camcraft_motion::machining2d, camcraft_motion::drilling and
camcraft_tools::tools. Comment-only; quick selection for changes in those
crates now matches these suites by their real owner.

Fixes #1417

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX
---
 crates/app/tests/altmill_machines.rs   | 2 +-
 crates/app/tests/doosan_dnm_a_state.rs | 2 +-
 crates/app/tests/lathe_post_inch.rs    | 2 +-
 crates/app/tests/program_units.rs      | 2 +-
 crates/app/tests/rotary_feed_cap.rs    | 2 +-
 crates/app/tests/thread_boss.rs        | 4 ++--
 crates/app/tests/thread_mill.rs        | 4 ++--
 crates/app/tests/thread_passes.rs      | 2 +-
 8 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crates/app/tests/altmill_machines.rs b/crates/app/tests/altmill_machines.rs
index f7bce6c2a..bc81b225a 100644
